2026-08-25T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-1054) 'The planner inside the studio core
 # uuid: 3db5b352-5ed1-5b50-a24c-2334da9db1d9
 # tags: rfd:title, rfd:attest-in:none
 RFD:Published  1 RFD
 Serials:Weftspun

2026-08-25T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-1054) '`weftspun_studio/`
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-1054) 'The planner lives inside the studio core, and `extension/` is deleted.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-1054) '`extension/` ran Elixir in an editor panel, through Popcorn and AtomVM. It proved the pipeline, and it could not ship.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-1054) 'Run `pipeline_test.exs`, which mocks nothing and runs the real planner over the real planning documents, before you merge a change to the planner.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-1054) 'The planner inside the studio core
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-1054) 'Delete `extension/`. Put the planner inside `weftspun_studio`, which RFD66606-1019 already makes the API server.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-1054) 'RFD66606-1023 gives the shape, and this RFD does not restate it.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-1054) 'RFD66606-1019 makes this the API server. RFD66606-1023 gives the shape. RFD66606-1037 gives the composite convention. RFD66606-1055 selects the worker host.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-1054) 'A second application was the wrong answer first
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-1054) 'This RFD first built `cms/`, a new Elixir application. That was a mistake, and the record of it matters more than the correction.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-1054) '`weftspun_studio` already held ports, adapters, an HTTP router, Ecto, and CockroachDB. RFD66606-1019 and RFD66606-1020 record it. The second application duplicated every one of those.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-1054) 'Three parts were new, and only those moved:
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-1054) '| Part               | Where it lives now              |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-1054) '| ------------------ | ------------------------------- |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-1054) '| Planning documents | `priv/domains`, `priv/problems` |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-1054) '| `Ports.Planner`    | Beside the other ports          |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-1054) '| `TaskweftPlanner`  | Beside the other adapters       |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-1054) '`cms/` is deleted. That also settles the overlap with RFD66606-1023, which this RFD carried while it described a parallel application.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-1054) 'Mock every port, and keep the documents real
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-1054) 'Every port is a `Mox` mock. A mock derives from the behavior, thus a port that gains a callback breaks its mock when it compiles.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-1054) 'The planning documents are the exception. A mocked domain proves nothing about the pipeline, because the domains are the pipeline. `pipeline_test.exs` mocks nothing, and it runs the real planner over the real documents.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-1054) 'The measured plans
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-1054) '| Pipeline     | Steps | Composes                                   |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-1054) '| ------------ | ----: | ------------------------------------------ |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-1054) '| content_only |     3 | the base alone                             |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-1054) '| mesh         |     7 | base and stage_mesh                        |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-1054) '| avatar       |    10 | base, stage_mesh, stage_rig, and a problem |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-1054) 'The avatar plan is the evidence. `stage_rig` calls `a_generate_mesh`, which `stage_mesh` defines, and that resolves only because the merge unions the actions of every document first.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-1054) 'Three faults came out of this
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-1054) 'The work needed three fixes to taskweft, and each came from use and not from reading. Each one answered `no_plan`, which names nothing.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-1054) '- Composition did not exist. `merge/2` was private to the CLI, and it took one domain and one problem. PR 207.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-1054) '- A shared variable replaced instead of merging its keys, thus the base lost the keys its own guards read. PR 208.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-1054) '- A goal serialized `eq: true` as the string `"true"`, thus it never matched a boolean in state. PR 209.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-1054) 'PR 207 also rewrote the DSL diagnostics. A domain written against an API that does not exist compiled without complaint, and returned an empty document.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-1054) 'Two routes
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-1054) '`/api/v1/pipelines` lists what this deployment knows. `/api/v1/pipelines/:name/plan` solves one and runs nothing, thus a caller sees the plan before it pays for the models.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-1054) '`Pipeline.parse/1` takes `String.to_existing_atom/1`. An HTTP caller must not fill the atom table, which never shrinks.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-1054) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-1054) 'AtomVM needs `SharedArrayBuffer`, thus the page must be cross-origin isolated. An editor webview is not isolated, and an extension cannot set the headers. The panel worked only with `codium --enable-coi`.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:40Z (RFD66606-1054) 'The proof stands, and the vehicle does not.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1054  1 LINE
 Text:Written
